Before trusting PROGRESS.md:
- detect missing/template/stale state
- discover roadmap/product/docs
- normalize docs
- reconstruct state from roadmap + repository evidence

If no useful project intent exists, ask the user what they want to build.
Do not invent a product.

`review project` happens after roadmap/state initialization and performs deep implementation verification.
